  "body": "Imagine stepping out your front door for a morning stroll along the golden sands of Browns Bay Beach, picking up your favourite coffee in the village, and returning home to peaceful views bordering the local bowling club. Positioned in one of the North Shore’s most vibrant seaside communities, 2/774 Beach Road delivers the ultimate low-maintenance lifestyle without compromising on quality, location or convenience.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Solid & Reliable Construction: Built in classic, enduring brick and tile for ultimate peace of mind.\r\n• Versatile Accommodation: 3 good-sized bedrooms and 1 central bathroom, plus a separate WC and basin off the third bedroom.\r\n• Separate Access – Work From Home Ready: The third bedroom has its own separate entrance, making it ideal as a home office, a guest bedroom, a teenager’s retreat or a quiet space to work from home without disturbing the household.\r\n• Unbeatable Lifestyle Location: An easy, flat walk to Browns Bay Village, local cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and the beach.\r\n• Serene Backdrop: Borders the lush, quiet greens of the Browns Bay Bowling Club.\r\n• Secure Parking: A single lock-up garage for parking or extra storage.\r\n• Outstanding Value: Sharply priced and ready to sell.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing to simplify daily life, or adding a reliable asset to your rental portfolio, this home is a standout opportunity. The separate-access room adds real flexibility: run your business from home, host visiting family in comfort, or give older kids their own space. Solid, low-maintenance homes this close to the heart of Browns Bay rarely come to market at such an accessible price. Buy with confidence, relax, and start enjoying the effortless coastal lifestyle you deserve.",
